# Update AGENTS.md

When a change teaches how this code actually behaves, write that into the nearest `AGENTS.md` in the same change. For legacy-parse, that file is `projects/bbi-sst/src/workflow/legacy-parse/AGENTS.md`.

Record facts a later edit would get wrong: write targets, read targets, task ownership, contracts, and gotchas. Replace a stale sentence instead of appending a second version of it.

Leave out session logs, execution ARNs, secrets, and one-off run notes.

```markdown
# ❌ Stale after the write target moves
ParseNew inserts into public."NewCustomers" only.

# ✅ Same change updates the note
ParseNew inserts through `legacyParseCampaignSchema`. `dryRun` selects the schema. It does not skip the write.
```
